<title>NORWAY: Nycomed Q1 operating profit per division.</title>
<headline>Nycomed Q1 operating profit per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating profit per division at Norwegian pharmaceuticals company Nycomed ASA for the three months to March 31.</p>
<p>				   (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Nycomed Imaging			384	vs	  553</p>
<p>  Nycomed Pharma			 130	vs	  114</p>
<p>  Research &amp; Development costs     189	vs	  206</p>
<p>  Unallocated/eliminations    minus 21	vs  minus  19</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
